WEBVTT

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.480
Ryo!

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.200
W-What?

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.110
Don’t you dare say “what” to me!

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:12.300
Sure, it’s all fine and dandy for you.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.220
You hated it, you fought it,
and now you can just ignore her.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:20.540
But did you ever stop and think
about how your mess affects Akane-chan?

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:25.940
Do you know how hard it is for
Kane-chan to see what Shizuka-chan is like

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:29.480
after you dumped her?

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:31.380
Anyways,

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:36.270
if you make Kane-chan cry again,
I won’t forgive you.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:37.520
Got it?!

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.560
Sure.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:53.450
So I don’t spill my wish from my eyes,

00:00:54.240 --> 00:01:00.310
I want to make my heart race to you.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:07.670
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:13.300
and paint them on my heart.

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:16.260
The sweetness

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:21.350
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:22.770
The time

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:29.190
is drawing bells in the sky.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:37.320
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.210
float in the wind,

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:41.090
flowing toward you,

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:44.560
freely.

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:51.380
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:55.010
It’s filling with colors.

00:01:55.010 --> 00:02:00.010
The Sleeting Snow of Love and Yearning
A Great, Tragic Love!!

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:03.910
I’m home.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:06.450
Welcome back.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.860
Dinner will be ready soon.

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:10.690
Shizuka-chan!

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:16.920
Since it was my own personal errands that caused me to be late,

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.760
I said that I’d make my own dinner.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:21.010
But it didn’t really bother me to make it.

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:25.520
Besides, Ryo-sama is always eating lunch with Emiho-sama,

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:26.960
so I thought I could at least make dinner.

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:29.540
Shizuka-chan…

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.480
Oh, all of sudden, I’m hungry.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:34.770
I’ll help once I get changed.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:38.030
All right, but you had better get changed in three seconds.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:38.990
Impossible!

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:45.480
So, you want me to take care of Akane for a while?

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:49.310
Yeah. I know this is sudden, but…

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.560
I don’t mind the fact that it’s sudden…

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.860
but are you sure it’s all right?

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:57.400
All right?

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.420
Ryo-kun,

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:01.370
I know how you feel,

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:06.060
but that wouldn’t really
solve the problem,

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:06.700
would it?

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:14.690
Besides, I don’t think Shizuka-chan ever had any bad intentions.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:17.940
Sure, she went about it the wrong way,

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:20.600
but I think she did what she did for your sake.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.510
But, Yurika-san!

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:24.810
Besides, Ryo-kun…

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:32.960
Is Akane-chan the only one who is suffering right now?

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:34.440
See?

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.250
Why?!

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:49.370
Neither Haru nor Yurika-san had to side with Shizuka.

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:07.280
Brother.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:08.520
Yo.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:11.310
You came in pretty late tonight.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:13.400
I’ll go warm up your dinner.

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:14.710
No thanks.

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:16.380
I already had dinner.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:19.900
But Shizuka-chan made it.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.760
I didn’t ask for that!

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.120
Don’t overdo it!

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:25.930
Sorry,

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:27.660
that wasn’t directed towards you.

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:29.640
I’m just tired of that idiot…

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:30.850
It’s still the same!

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.170
Akane…

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:37.200
Sure, Shizuka-chan was at fault too,

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:38.650
but…

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:41.190
I…

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:45.410
I know how Shizuka-chan feels!

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:48.920
Akane…

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:53.200
You don’t understand what Shizuka-chan is like at all.

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:58.030
She’s not the nasty person that you believe she is.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.150
But…

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.900
But you…

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:14.200
I made it absolutely clear to you

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:17.760
and yet you still made her cry!

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:20.940
I couldn’t help it!

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:22.800
I just can’t help being
unable to forgive her!

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:26.550
You idiot!

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:34.000
Everyone makes mistakes.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.370
Don’t you have any desire to get closer to her?

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:38.400
You’re such a tight ass.

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:49.390
Damn, it’s easy for you to talk.

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:56.480
Shizuka-chan is trying to be strong and act like nothing is wrong,

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:01.100
but since you started dating Emiho-san,

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:04.070
she’s been very, very hurt.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.760
Now, let’s review.

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:10.490
As seen above,

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:13.620
when you take x², x²+1,

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:18.210
x²-2, x²+3…

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:18.900
Brother,

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:25.780
please try to look at the real Shizuka-chan.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.810
Why do you always have to do so much?

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.380
It had to happen on the only day I didn’t bring an umbrella.

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:53.260
It was so sunny this morning too.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:56.080
You said you had an important lesson to go to today.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.540
Will you be okay?

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:59.920
I have an appointment too, so…

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:01.880
Oh, I’ll be fine.

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:03.250
I’ll manage.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:06.000
You may use mine, if you would like.

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:09.780
I have transportation waiting for me, so…

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:11.220
Really?

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:12.740
You really saved my day!

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:16.790
We should help one another when in need, right?

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:22.040
Thanks, Shizuka-chan.

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:23.860
I really appreciate it.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.900
Shizuka…

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:45.900
Yes!

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:59.500
Looks like I only heard the wind.

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:12.520
You…

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:48.730
I’m cold…

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:09.200
Kitty…

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.450
Come here.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.580
Come.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.020
Ryo-sama.

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:34.530
Let’s go home.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:36.510
Okay.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:47.080
Ryo-sama…

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:50.580
I just don’t want to get beaten up by Miki again.

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:51.940
That’s why.

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:55.590
I know you’re not that kind of person.

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:17.440
Gooooood…

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.900
To Be Continued

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:24.360
The moment came

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:28.360
very much out of the blue.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:33.500
You showed up right in front of me,

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:36.220
then started to change everything.

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:40.050
If my meeting you

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:43.900
is not by fate,

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:49.260
there are no miracles,

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:54.450
even if I search all over the world.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:57.840
Embracing love,

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:01.770
kissing love,

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:05.700
holding love,

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:10.000
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:14.030
Please look at me and me alone,

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:17.450
forever.

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:23.290
Wow, that was so exciting!!

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:26.560
That was a good fight, Shizuka-chan.
It must’ve been hard to knock her out.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:30.260
My move worked, didn’t it? You two’d better thank me!

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:33.600
As I’ve said, Ryo-sama is not that kind of person.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:37.530
But it’s too bad he’s so lacking in courtesy.

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:40.120
Huh? Yurika-san, they gave you a route, too?

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.820
What do you mean by “route”?

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:43.860
Whoa now, stop right there.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.830
Ah, Emi-rin makes her entrance!

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:50.830
By the way, most pro-wrestlers these days wouldn’t be caught dead using that move.

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:53.290
Oh well~

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:56.740
It’s called the Cobra Twist!

00:12:56.740 --> 00:12:58.750
Though it doesn’t work on other girls.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:03.090
H-Hey, knock it off! If you don’t, things are going to get weird on several levels!

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:04.610
Whatever do you mean?

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.520
Your story’s up next, Akane-chan. Do your best.

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:11.250
But… I’m going to be in bed the whole time.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:16.870
That’s right! Final Approach
is going to keep chugging along!

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:21.030
If you don’t buy the DVDs,
I’ll sic the men in black on you!

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:22.340
Aw, come on, Shizuka-chan!

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:23.880
What’s she talking about?

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:26.340
Hey now, what’s going on here?
